# Standard release R8 shrinking, optimization and obfuscation remain enabled.
# Preserve only the native binding names and shapes required below.

# sherpa-onnx 1.13.8, source 11afbd009a7f8c08f4bcf2fc1b265d0df4670fbf.
# JNI GetOfflineConfig, GetOnlineModelConfig/GetConfig, GetOfflineTtsConfig and
# GetVadModelConfig read these exact fields through common.h macros/GetFieldID.
# Types come from classes.jar in the prepared sherpa-onnx-1.13.8-pair-v1.aar.
# All sibling configs are traversed, including unselected models. Keep field
# storage/values and descriptor classes; unrelated methods remain shrinkable.
# Native entry points use Android's default native-method rules; Tencent retains
# its two boundary classes through its existing AAR consumer rules.

